                      <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='24'>Light pollution: Irrelevant or important</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='18'>Light pollution levels have been staying consistent in the past few years, but is it an issue?</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='14'>Light pollution is an often overlooked issue. However, that does not downplay it&apos;s seriousness. Singapore is the </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontsize='14'>most </run>
                      <run fontsize='14'>light polluted country in the world and it affects us in ways we usually don&apos;t even see.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='18'>Light pollution can lead to:</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='14'>- Inteferance with people&apos;s circadian rhythm, which causes issues with sleep and increased risk of chronic conditions</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='14'>- Disruption of natural ecosystems, causing animals to lose their habitats</run>
                    </formatted-text>
